# How to cite this project. Format: https://citation-file-format.github.io/
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results, please cite this project."
type: software
title: "Thai Token Tax: how many more tokens Thai text costs than the same English text on major AI models"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark of how many tokens the tokenizers of major AI models spend on Thai
  text compared with the same content in English, and what that costs in baht at official list
  prices. It measures cost, not answer quality.
authors:
  - name: "Thai Token Tax authors"
version: 0.1.0
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - tokenizer
  - Thai
  - large language models
  - benchmark
  - cost
repository-code: "https://github.com/neptunenakub/thai-token-tax"
url: "https://neptunenakub.github.io/thai-token-tax/"
references:
  - type: article
    title: "No Language Left Behind: Scaling Human-Centered Machine Translation"
    authors:
      - name: "NLLB Team"
    year: 2022
    notes: "FLORES-200, the dataset measured here (CC BY-SA 4.0). arXiv:2207.04672"
